	(text "5V rail:\n\nBuck pre-regulator: TPS563201 (4.5-17V in, 2A, synchronous), set to ~6V @ 2A intermediate output\nLDO cleanup stage: LM1085-5.0 (fixed 5V, 3A rated, ~1V dropout at 2A), taking the 6V intermediate down to a clean 5V"
		(at 79.756 20.066 0)
		(effects
